1348 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Climate action is only as strong as the data that informs it\056 But most data stacks weren\031t designed with emissions\054 supply chains\054 or climate modeling in mind\056 Teams are often stuck retrofitting existing systems or relying on brittle workarounds to generate insights\056 It\031s time to rethink our infrastructure\024starting with the foundation\056)
     /K [ 63 ]
     /P 1349 0 R
     /Pg 1222 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

