1352 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Most data infrastructures were built to optimize for sales\054 user growth\054 or cost\024not carbon\056 This creates friction when sustainability teams try to source emissions data from systems that weren\031t designed to capture it\056 Without foundational visibility\054 even basic reporting becomes a manual\054 error\055prone task\056 The result\077 Delays\054 duplications\054 and disconnects\056\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMost data infrastructures were built to optimize for sales\054 user growth\054 or cost\024not carbon\056 This creates friction when sustainability teams try to source emissions data from systems that weren\031t designed to capture it\056 Without foundational visibility\054 even basic reporting becomes a manual\054 error\055prone task\056 The result\077 Delays\054 duplications\054 and disconnects\056)
     /K [ 65 ]
     /P 1353 0 R
     /Pg 1222 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
