  << /ActualText (A modern climate stack isn\031t just a bundle of tools\024it\031s an integrated system that mirrors how your business actually operates\056 This means prioritizing interoperability\054 aligning metrics across platforms\054 and investing in foundational data governance\056 Tools alone won\031t solve emissions blind spots\024strategy will\056)
     /K [ 67 ]
